@title AddMonsterBurn
 @notice Upgrades a running deployment for ADR 0023 (monster burns signed by their owner): Monster 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0
         (BURNER_ROLE), MintManager 1.2.0 -> 1.3.0 (burnMonsters, EIP-712 domain), then lets the MintManager burn.
         Every state is kept (UUPS upgrades, validated against the deployed versions in test/UpgradeSafety.t.sol).
         A fresh deployment does not need this: script/Deploy.s.sol does it.
 @dev Environment: ADMIN_ADDRESS (holds DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE and UPGRADER_ROLE, signs), MONSTER, MINT_MANAGER.
